      "description": "<p data-start=\"517\" data-end=\"564\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\"><strong data-start=\"517\" data-end=\"564\">Neil Diamond – Love On The Rocks / Acapulco</strong><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchor\"></span></p>\n<p data-start=\"566\" data-end=\"834\">Original 1980 Capitol Records 45 RPM single featuring <strong data-start=\"620\" data-end=\"644\">\"Love On The Rocks,\"</strong> one of Neil Diamond's signature hits from <em data-start=\"687\" data-end=\"704\">The Jazz Singer</em> soundtrack, backed with <strong data-start=\"729\" data-end=\"744\">\"Acapulco.\"</strong> A great addition to any classic rock, pop, singer-songwriter, or Neil Diamond collection.</p>\n<p data-start=\"836\" data-end=\"893\">This is an authentic vintage U.S. pressing—not a reissue.</p>\n<hr data-start=\"895\" data-end=\"898\">\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1j02m21\" data-start=\"900\" data-end=\"918\">Record Details</h3>\n<ul data-start=\"920\" data-end=\"1106\">\n<li data-section-id=\"196n6ep\" data-start=\"920\" data-end=\"942\">\nArtist: Neil Diamond\n</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"aa400s\" data-start=\"943\" data-end=\"969\">\nTitle: Love On The Rocks\n</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"eb7pk0\" data-start=\"970\" data-end=\"988\">\nB-Side: Acapulco\n</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1jsep0m\" data-start=\"989\" data-end=\"1013\">\nLabel: Capitol Records\n</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"35lwed\" data-start=\"1014\" data-end=\"1036\">\nCatalog Number: 4939\n</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"mn8imy\" data-start=\"1037\" data-end=\"1062\">\nFormat: 7\" Vinyl Single\n</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"r3wzuj\" data-start=\"1063\" data-end=\"1078\">\nSpeed: 45 RPM\n</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"10vwi65\" data-start=\"1079\" data-end=\"1093\">\nCountry: USA\n</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"lzrz25\" data-start=\"1094\" data-end=\"1106\">\nYear: 1980\n</li>\n</ul>\n<hr data-start=\"1108\" data-end=\"1111\">\n<h3 data-section-id=\"17si63v\" data-start=\"1113\" data-end=\"1130\">Track Listing</h3>\n<p data-start=\"1132\" data-end=\"1142\"><strong data-start=\"1132\" data-end=\"1142\">Side A</strong></p>\n<ul data-start=\"1143\" data-end=\"1169\">\n<li data-section-id=\"1gdwv09\" data-start=\"1143\" data-end=\"1169\">\nLove On The Rocks – 3:41\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p data-start=\"1171\" data-end=\"1181\"><strong data-start=\"1171\" data-end=\"1181\">Side B</strong></p>\n<ul data-start=\"1182\" data-end=\"1199\">\n<li data-section-id=\"1m2cjzo\" data-start=\"1182\" data-end=\"1199\">\nAcapulco – 2:45\n</li>\n</ul>\n<hr data-start=\"1201\" data-end=\"1204\">\n<h2 data-section-id=\"hrykuu\" data-start=\"1206\" data-end=\"1218\">Condition</h2>\n<p data-start=\"1220\" data-end=\"1233\"><strong data-start=\"1220\" data-end=\"1230\">Vinyl:</strong> VG</p>\n<ul data-start=\"1234\" data-end=\"1470\">\n<li data-section-id=\"1dgyjyp\" data-start=\"1234\" data-end=\"1319\">\nOriginal vinyl retains a nice shine with light cosmetic wear from age and handling.\n</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"10lcrpp\" data-start=\"1320\" data-end=\"1357\">\nLabels are clean and fully legible.\n</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"11ntj00\" data-start=\"1358\" data-end=\"1395\">\nNo cracks, chips, or warping noted.\n</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"ktdhob\" data-start=\"1396\" data-end=\"1470\">\nVisually graded; a professional cleaning is recommended before playback.\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p data-start=\"1472\" data-end=\"1483\"><strong data-start=\"1472\" data-end=\"1483\">Sleeve:</strong></p>\n<ul data-start=\"1484\" data-end=\"1558\">\n<li data-section-id=\"wehbnn\" data-start=\"1484\" data-end=\"1558\">\nShips in a new white paper sleeve inside a protective poly outer sleeve.\n</li>\n</ul>",
